:: Start
<% s.hasKey = false; %>
You stand before a heavy oak door.
[[Search the floor|Search]]
[[Try the handle|Try Handle]]

:: Search
<% s.hasKey = true; %>
A small iron key glints among the leaves.
[[Take it and try the door|Try Handle]]

:: Try Handle
<% if (s.hasKey) { %>The key turns smoothly. The door swings open.
[[Step inside|Cellar]]<% } else { %>The handle won't budge.
[[Search the floor|Search]]<% } %>

:: Cellar [ending]
A cool cellar greets you. The end.
